Package: stagemap
Title: Relation Maps for 'Shiny' and 'Quarto'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Harsh", "Verma", email = "analyticswithharsh@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Builds relation maps from nodes placed by stage and lane and
    links that join them. Checks node identifiers, link endpoints and column
    values, lays the map out the same way on every run and writes it as an
    SVG image.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://insightsurge.github.io/stagemap/, https://github.com/insightsurge/stagemap
BugReports: https://github.com/insightsurge/stagemap/issues
