    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: 
    checkmate,
    cli,
    grDevices
Suggests: 
    chromote,
    covr,
    jsonlite,
    shiny,
    shinytest2 (>= 0.5.0),
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
